<title>GREECE: GREEK 1M ATHIBOR SLIPS TO 12.21PCT FROM 12.22PCT.</title>
<headline>GREEK 1M ATHIBOR SLIPS TO 12.21PCT FROM 12.22PCT.</headline>
<text>
<p>ATHENS, Jan 20 Reuter) - The Athens Interbank Offered Rate</p>
<p>(Athibor) for one month slipped to 12.21 percent from 12.22</p>
<p>percent on Friday and the bid rate (Athibid) was unchanged at</p>
<p>11.71 percent.</p>
